# cps2recomp input movie: frame player1 player2 (pressed bits, hex)
# An input movie to drive the D&D operator menu (the test switch is held, so the game's own
# menu shows): down to CONFIGURATION, into it, down to SYSTEM, into it, down to CHUTE TYPE,
# right (to change it to four players), and out with EXIT.
#
# The bits of a player's controls (machine/machine.h):
#   right 0x001  left 0x002  down 0x004  up 0x008
#   punch1 0x010  punch2 0x020  punch3 0x040
#   kick1 0x080   kick2 0x100   kick3 0x200
#   start 0x400   coin 0x800
#
# The game's menu takes the directions and the first button (the "SELECT" of its own wording).
1000 0004
1060 0000
1120 0004
1180 0000
1240 0004
1300 0000
